~ start
Luna: So... you dare face another reflection? I am Luna, Warden of Shadows.  
Luna: Let us see if your reasoning pierces the obscurity.  
[do! get_tree().get_first_node_in_group("player").lock_player()]
[do! DialogueManager.luna.face_player()]
=> Q11

~ Q11
Luna: What value of x will satisfy the equation -2?  
- A. -π/4 => Q11_WRONG
- B. -π/4 => Q11_WRONG
- C. -π/2 => Q11_CORRECT
- D. π/2 => Q11_WRONG

~ Q11_CORRECT
Luna: Correct. Even in negativity, clarity prevails. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_correct_answer()]
=> Q12

~ Q11_WRONG
Luna: Shadows mislead you. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END

~ Q12
Luna: The equation sin²(x) + cos²(x) - 6 = 0 has how many possible solutions?  
- A. 0 => Q12_CORRECT
- B. 1 => Q12_WRONG
- C. 5 => Q12_WRONG
- D. infinite => Q12_WRONG

~ Q12_CORRECT
Luna: Zero is still an answer. Well done. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_correct_answer()]
=> Q13

~ Q12_WRONG
Luna: Even patterns can deceive. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END

~ Q13
Luna: What is the equivalent of cos²(x) - sin(x)?  
- A. sin(x)(1 + sin(x)) => Q13_WRONG
- B. sin(x)(1 - sin(x)) => Q13_CORRECT
- C. (1 - sin(x))(1 + sin(x)) => Q13_WRONG
- D. (1 - sin(x))(1 - sin(x)) => Q13_WRONG

~ Q13_CORRECT
Luna: Accuracy shines through the reflection. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_correct_answer()]
=> Q14

~ Q13_WRONG
Luna: The reflection distorts your choice. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END

~ Q14
Luna: Which value satisfies 2 tan(x) − sec²(x) = 0?  
- A. 7π/4 => Q14_WRONG
- B. 5π/4 => Q14_WRONG
- C. π/4 => Q14_CORRECT
- D. 11π/4 => Q14_WRONG

~ Q14_CORRECT
Luna: Precisely. The balance of tangent and secant is yours. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_correct_answer()]
=> Q15

~ Q14_WRONG
Luna: Tangent slips through your grasp. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END

~ Q15
Luna: What is the general solution of 2 cos(2x) - 3 = 0?  
- A. 11π/12 + kπ => Q15_WRONG
- B. π/3 + k(2π) => Q15_WRONG
- C. k(2π) => Q15_WRONG
- D. π/6 + kπ => Q15_CORRECT

~ Q15_CORRECT
Luna: The reflection aligns with your answer.  [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_death()]
[do! get_tree().get_first_node_in_group("player").unlock_player()]
[do! DialogueManager.luna.queue_free()]
=> END

~ Q15_WRONG
Luna: Even general solutions can mislead. [do! DialogueManager.luna.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END
